620 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bdab728a/uploads/origins/409e7d8d-c384-457d-87ba-ac0c33580080?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cdfef29be7339daae32778b6e70dc7d6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bdab728a/uploads/origins/409e7d8d-c384-457d-87ba-ac0c33580080?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=56bb071bb4b3a154631acc61f031aeeb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bdab728a/uploads/origins/409e7d8d-c384-457d-87ba-ac0c33580080?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=56bb071bb4b3a154631acc61f031aeeb, https://si.imgix.net/bdab728a/uploads/origins/409e7d8d-c384-457d-87ba-ac0c33580080?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a5fdbebd2dcad5d59267d9963e3c991b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bdab728a/uploads/origins/409e7d8d-c384-457d-87ba-ac0c33580080?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=90108fc8ab72b31d0596248e80df9b28 3x"}, "body": "I would be happy if you could draw my character, King!\n\nThey are a professional figure skater and an ice skating prodigy who had to stop skating because they fell during their Olympics performance.\n\nThey are a perfectionist who is very hard on themselves, and who is obsessed with winning. They have the mentality of \"Anything that is not first place is a loss!\" and \"Ice Skating is the only thing I can do, so I must be the best at it!\". Because they did not accomplish their goal, they feel very angry and disappointed with their own failure. They can be rude and insensitive to people at times, and is always scowling or looking angry, but they have a good heart and secretly cares for people a lot! They want people to be the best versions of themselves, but it always comes across wrongly as scolding or nagging. \n\nKing has a tsundere personality! They are introverted and like a stray black cat who you need to slowly tame before they like you. They are very androgynous, and have multiple piercings on both ears!\n\nThemes: Ice Skating, Black Cats, Ice Sculptures, Broken Marble Sculptures, Victory\n\nYou can change their outfit if you'd like! Everything else is up to you. Thank you for your consideration! Please have a nice day!\nhttps://toyhou.se/27202186.mouse-king-wu", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@3zuno_kawa/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1215207, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7a4f08f3/uploads/origins/e0b09007-bb78-4e20-bd18-20b3b59932e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23d840926b29224afff036b5b7fd1500", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7a4f08f3/uploads/origins/e0b09007-bb78-4e20-bd18-20b3b59932e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23d840926b29224afff036b5b7fd1500, https://si.imgix.net/7a4f08f3/uploads/origins/e0b09007-bb78-4e20-bd18-20b3b59932e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb6b9f776ed4473fa3b40150f69482dc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7a4f08f3/uploads/origins/e0b09007-bb78-4e20-bd18-20b3b59932e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b6498f0cedc01a726d11d8fb6757619 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7a4f08f3/uploads/origins/e0b09007-bb78-4e20-bd18-20b3b59932e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=98d771d2b2e2a0d92c607299ea6f28e9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7a4f08f3/uploads/origins/e0b09007-bb78-4e20-bd18-20b3b59932e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=98d771d2b2e2a0d92c